{"unit_id":"tag:02XY:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个群胚纤维范畴（category fibred in groupoids）。存在一个反变函子（contravariant functor）<MATH_0002>，使得<MATH_0003>与<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上等价（equivalent）。换言之，每个群胚纤维范畴（category fibred in groupoids）都等价（equivalent）于一个分裂的（split）群胚纤维范畴。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴","context":"本陈述的纤维范畴类型。"},{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子","context":"本陈述构造的函子。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"在基底范畴上的等价。"},{"source_term":"split","target_term":"分裂的","context":"纤维范畴的分裂性质。"}],"notes":[]}
